高了一些。\n\n我是一名在中国活动的个人vtuber。人物设定是一名来自1920年代纽约的黑帮大小姐。表面是享乐主义的纨绔子弟，但心里十分担忧着家族和朋友，对下属很严厉并且有自己的野心。\n这是我的人物立绘和其他老师为我绘制的作品，可以用于参考：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12TLkvZE7HhhZb-WdyxgE3SxLfFTPi9FJ\n\n我希望您能为我的翻唱作品《young and beautiful》创作视频。歌曲原唱是lana del rey\n或者您可以直接根据这段歌词创作画面\nI've seen the world, Done it all, had my cake now,\n Diamonds, brilliant, and Bel-Air now, \nHot summer nights, mid-July, \nWhen you and I were forever wild,\n The crazy days, city lights, \nThe way you'd play with me like a child, \nWill you still love me when I'm no longer young and beautiful, \nWill you still love me when I got nothing but my aching soul, I \nknow you will, I know you will, I know that you will. \n因为非常非常欣赏您的创意，所以欢迎您多多的自由发挥。\n如果能体现角色内心的孤独感就更好了\n\n您的作品我会用图片和视频的形式发布在我的sns和视频内容中。\n非常感谢您", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "video", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kousyanomado/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "video", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2549724, "client_id": 2262289, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d69d1afc/uploads/outputs/7582c59f-4809-441e-9172-b327cc9efaf6?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2a374169cd54efbde157bc841dcdd5af", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d69d1afc/uploads/outputs/7582c59f-4809-441e-9172-b327cc9efaf6?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2a374169cd54efbde157bc841dcdd5af, https://si.imgix.net/d69d1afc/uploads/outputs/7582c59f-4809-441e-9172-b327cc9efaf6?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de717f55959175382df3ade88b8ca91d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d69d1afc/uploads/outputs/7582c59f-4809-441e-9172-b327cc9efaf6?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=88fb7b4526ba1ec77a4dc1c95f26f219 3x"}, "duration": 16, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d69d1afc/uploads/outputs/7582c59f